//          bun compiler/bin/scrml.js build <d>
// Expected: the full message, as `scrml compile` prints it (no SPEC sentence on CLI formatting — cosmetic).
// Actual:   `[warn] …/app.scrml:1:1 W-PROGRAM-SPA-INFERRED: The compiler has inferred SPA (single-page
//           application) shape from the filesystem: the entry file declares a top-level `` — the sentence
//           stops mid-token and the fix-it (create a `pages/` directory …) is never shown.
//           Root (traced): compiler/src/commands/build.js:1002
//           `console.warn(`  [warn] ${rel}${loc} ${w.code}: ${stripRedundantCode(w.code, w.message)?.slice(0, 120)}`)`.
